Install ollama   :  https://ollama.com/download
Command prompt   :  https://ollama.com/library/deepseek-r1

For having a interactive UI;

Install openWebUi: https://docs.openwebui.com/
Install Docker
Command prompt: docker run -d -p 3000:8080 --add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway -v open-webui:/app/backend/data --name open-webui --restart always ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:main
Check in Docker, if the deepseek image is up and running
Web browser:   localhost:3000/auth
and Voila!’
